      "text": "Backups: daily 04:00 by default · keep the last 14 scheduled · pre-operation backups 30 days · pinned never pruned.\nConsistency per adapter: stop | saveThenCopy | hot. Cancelling during SteamCMD leaves the files as they are and marks the instance \"needs verify\".",
